WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Put 2 grams of germinating
seeds in a sealed tube,

2
00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:07.340
joined to a thin glass tube
holding one bead of liquid.

3
00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:11.180
Stand it in a water bath
at 25 degrees Celsius.

4
00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:13.830
At first, nothing seems to happen.

5
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.670
Within 10 minutes, the bead
has crept along the tube.

6
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.770
So how can a creeping bead
show how fast seeds respire,

7
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.740
and which fuel they use?

8
00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.610
In this mission, you'll
set up a respirometer,

9
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:30.330
with a control tube of glass
beads to catch false movement.

10
00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.360
Then you'll turn the bead's
distance into a volume,

11
00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:35.710
and a rate per gram per minute.

12
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:40.890
Your mission: find out how a creeping
bead reveals how fast seeds respire,

13
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.530
and which fuel they use.
